    heading: "send-and-receive-messages-4",
    content: "To read and display received chat messages, you add code to the `OnMessagesReceived` callback of the `IChatManagerDelegate`. To implement all `IChatManagerDelegate` callbacks, add the following code to the `MainWindow` class:"
